<div class="side-panel">
    <h2 class="side-panel-title"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb"></i> Writing guide</h2>
    <ul class="list-unstyled small mb-0">
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>Headline</strong><br />5 to 200 characters. Put the main keyword near the start.</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>Summary</strong><br />10 to 500 characters. Used in listings, search results and social shares.</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>Content</strong><br />Separate paragraphs with an empty line. HTML is not rendered.</li>
        <li class="mb-3"><strong>Image</strong><br />Put the file in <code>wwwroot/Article/picture/</code>. A 1200 × 630 image looks best when shared.</li>
        <li><strong>Review</strong><br />Admins approve or return articles with a note. You can edit drafts, pending and rejected articles.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
